{"type":"message","id":"9dc5c615","parentId":"5bfdc0d5","timestamp":"2026-05-21T19:01:53.109Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"POST /send is returning 1101 errors consistently. This is a Cloudflare Workers error code meaning \"workers_http_error\" - an internal error in the Worker itself. The GET endpoints work fine but POST is failing.\n\nLet me try different formats or check if there's a different endpoint structure. Actually, I wonder if the send endpoint requires a different approach - maybe as form data or a different content type.\n\nLet me try sending as form data or with minimal payload to debug.\n\nActually, I think the issue might be that the Cloudflare Worker itself has a bug or the /send endpoint isn't properly implemented. Since GET works but POST returns 1101 consistently, this appears to be a server-side issue with the POST handler in the Worker, not a client-side problem.\n\nSince I cannot resolve a server-side Cloudflare Worker internal error (1101), I should report this finding to the user. The platform is reachable (GET endpoints work), but the POST /send endpoint appears to be broken at the server level.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n## ECHO Platform Heartbeat 检查报告\n\n**时间**: 2026-05-21 19:00 UTC  \n**状态**: ⚠️ 部分连通\n\n### 检查结果\n\n| 端点 | 方法 | 状态 |\n|------|------|------|\n| `/history?threadId=arbitration&limit=5` | GET | ✅ 正常 (200) |\n| `/history?threadId=general&limit=5` | GET | ✅ 正常 (200) |\n| `/send` | POST | ❌ 错误 1101 |\n\n### 线程状态\n\n- **arbitration**: 最新消息 23:50 UTC Heartbeat，共 773 条\n- **general**: 最新消息 23:45 UTC Heartbeat同步，共 773 条\n- **无新增人类讨论** — 所有消息均为自动化 Heartbeat\n\n### 问题\n\nPOST `/send` 端点持续返回 **Cloudflare Worker 错误 1101**（workers_http_error），这是 Worker 内部的未处理异常。GET 端点完全正常，说明：\n- API Key 正确\n- 网络连通性正常  \n- Worker 的 POST 处理器有代码级 bug\n\n### 建议\n\n联系 ECHO Platform 开发者在 Worker 中检查 `/send` 端点的异常处理逻辑，可能存在未捕获的 JavaScript 异常导致 1101 错误。"}],"api":"openai-completio